00:44:12,510 --> 00:44:14,670
Highlight the most important metrics, they said.

902
00:44:15,390 --> 00:44:16,990
Don't drown people in numbers.

903
00:44:17,770 --> 00:44:19,520
Focus on what really matters.

904
00:44:19,670 --> 00:44:21,110
Icons, they liked those.

905
00:44:21,770 --> 00:44:25,470
Visual representations of key ideas helps people remember.

906
00:44:25,670 --> 00:44:26,870
They're like little memory treasures.

907
