They even talked about like interactive stuff.

908
00:44:29,340 --> 00:44:32,680
Maybe let people guess a trend before you reveal the chart, that kind of thing.

909
00:44:32,720 --> 00:44:33,680
Keeps them on their toes.

910
00:44:33,780 --> 00:44:34,360
Engaging.

911
00:44:34,520 --> 00:44:38,040
And make sure those images are high res, you know, professional.

912
00:44:38,220 --> 00:44:39,040
Details matter.

913
