00:47:04,190 --> 00:47:07,530
Have some friends, colleagues watch you, give you feedback.

970
00:47:08,310 --> 00:47:09,870
Fresh eyes are so valuable.

971
00:47:10,170 --> 00:47:11,900
Practice with your actual slides.

972
00:47:11,980 --> 00:47:13,180
Get that flow down.

973
