1038
00:49:31,000 --> 00:49:36,380
They were all about recapping those benefits, making sure people understand how to apply what they've learned.

1039
00:49:36,700 --> 00:49:39,230
You want people to walk away with something they can actually use.

1040
00:49:39,530 --> 00:49:41,370
A strong call to action, too, you know?

1041
