Tell people exactly what you want them to do next.

1042
00:49:43,970 --> 00:49:44,820
Give them direction.

1043
00:49:45,440 --> 00:49:47,600
Ending with a powerful quote, that was another idea.

1044
00:49:47,780 --> 00:49:49,400
Something that encapsulates your theme.

1045
00:49:49,720 --> 00:49:50,930
It could be very memorable.

1046
