Maybe a simple infographic that captures the essence of your message.

1066
00:50:35,900 --> 00:50:38,260
A final image that stays with people.

1067
00:50:38,440 --> 00:50:40,620
And maybe a little inspirational story at the end.

1068
00:50:41,030 --> 00:50:43,010
You know, to leave people feeling motivated.

1069
00:50:43,390 --> 00:50:44,390
Send them off on a high note.

1070
00:50:44,710 --> 00:50:47,510
But don't introduce any new stuff in your conclusion.

1071
00:50:47,570 --> 00:50:48,600
That was a big no-no.

1072
00:50:49,040 --> 00:50:51,260
Just focus on reinforcing what you've already said.

1073
00:50:51,380 --> 00:50:53,420
Yeah, you don't want to confuse people at this point.

1074
00:50:53,720 --> 00:50:54,620
A strong conclusion.

