It's about driving your message home, isn't it?

1076
00:50:57,160 --> 00:50:57,800
Absolutely.

1077
00:50:58,100 --> 00:50:59,440
Leaving a lasting impression.

1078
00:50:59,740 --> 00:50:59,940
All right.

