1090
00:51:38,240 --> 00:51:40,780
Yeah, because everyone has a different preference.

1091
00:51:40,800 --> 00:51:44,710
If people said they wanted more interaction, they'd add in some polls, that kind of thing.

1092
00:51:45,130 --> 00:51:47,610
It's about being responsive to your audience's needs.

1093
00:51:48,150 --> 00:51:53,780
