1094
00:51:54,120 --> 00:51:55,160
It builds trust.

1095
00:51:55,490 --> 00:52:01,080
They even considered giving out, like, a summary handout at the end, you know, something people could take away.

1096
00:52:01,120 --> 00:52:02,240
Nice little takeaway.

1097
00:52:02,260 --> 00:52:05,310
They updated their examples, too, to make sure they were current.

1098
00:52:05,810 --> 00:52:06,730
Got to stay relevant.

1099
00:52:06,750 --> 00:52:10,820
And they were super careful about data accuracy, double-checking everything.

1100
00:52:10,880 --> 00:52:11,740
Yeah, that's crucial.

